  (Eng, Short, [6566267], "Sami called our radio station."),
  (Eng, Short, [9139587], "We dozed off."),
  (Eng, Short, [6793216], "How long was your trip?"),
  (Eng, Short, [400388], "Speaking in English is fun."),
  (Eng, Short, [7407759], "They can do that on their own."),
  (Eng, Short, [12005439], "You can't have it all."),
  (Eng, Short, [310028], "She is a bit like her mother."),
  (Eng, Short, [4269626], "Flowers do not talk."),
  (Eng, Short, [6448392], "Sami is taking care of Layla."),
  (Eng, Short, [6428795], "Mary walked into her room."),
  (Eng, Short, [8394897], "He wrote my speech."),
  (Eng, Short, [12967673], "Cool earrings!"),
  (Eng, Short, [10901742], "I want some water to drink."),
  (Eng, Short, [715045], "My neighbor's dog is dead."),
  (Eng, Short, [287826], "His paper reads like a novel."),
  (Eng, Short, [8622423], "\"Some peanuts?\" \"No, thanks.\""),
  (Eng, Short, [8850115], "I like travel!"),
  (Eng, Short, [4953381], "I hope Tom does that."),
  (Eng, Short, [7248587], "Sami was almost six feet."),
  (Eng, Short, [10217222], "Ziri was dancing at work."),
  (Eng, Short, [38728], "I do want to go to Italy."),
  (Eng, Short, [831597], "Cut the cake with that knife."),
  (Eng, Medium, [7183174], "Tom and I often go to Australia."),
  (Eng, Medium, [5851931], "I expected to pay at least thirty dollars."),
  (Eng, Medium, [13107988], "He cannot afford it because he is poor."),
  (
    Eng,
    Medium,
    [879765],
    "When you don't eat leafy foods, you can't get vitamins.",
  ),
  (Eng, Medium, [956804], "I found a very nice place today."),
  (
    Eng,
    Medium,
    [10461488],
    "I'd be the happiest person in the world if I was next to you.",
  ),
  (Eng, Medium, [13584776], "People seem to find this foolishness funny."),
  (Eng, Medium, [13433266], "My father can neither read nor write."),
  (Eng, Medium, [12689600], "I think Tom was pressured into doing that."),
  (
    Eng,
    Medium,
    [7860148],
    "The baby turtles hatched from their eggs and ran towards the sea.",
  ),
  (Eng, Medium, [6244815], "I just can't imagine myself doing that."),
  (
    Eng,
    Medium,
    [13216213],
    "From our family to yours, we send our warmest wishes.",
  ),
  (Eng, Medium, [7182849], "Tom said that everyone he knows has done that."),
  (Eng, Medium, [5212493], "I'm pretty sure it was Tom that I saw."),
  (Eng, Medium, [9999864], "Why don't we list the pros and cons?"),
  (Eng, Medium, [6051510], "Does he really believe what he says?"),
  (
    Eng,
    Medium,
    [7504913],
    "You know that Tom is still in love with you, don't you?",
  ),
  (Eng, Medium, [3199003], "Tom often takes a nap after lunch."),
  (Eng, Medium, [11847279], "Miroslav skated swiftly past Rima."),
  (Eng, Medium, [9519344], "The bullet is still in Tom's leg."),
  (Eng, Medium, [6424089], "Mary looked like she was skeptical."),
  (Eng, Medium, [11005560], "The director wasn't happy with the change."),
  (Eng, Medium, [318122], "An airship is lighter than air."),
  (
    Eng,
    Medium,
    [682065],
    "The Constitution gives certain rights to the states.",
  ),
  (Eng, Medium, [6663341], "You don't think Tom can swim, do you?"),
  (Eng, Medium, [1584122], "He deserves six of the best for being so rude."),
  (Eng, Medium, [6897907], "Everybody asks you that, don't they?"),
  (Eng, Medium, [7294455], "Sami kept writing in his spiral notebook."),
  (Eng, Medium, [5193343], "I want you to hold this while I open the door."),
  (
    Eng,
    Medium,
    [7502177],
    "You know that I wouldn't be stupid enough to do that, don't you?",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [7198122, 6694823, 3736066, 7348221],
    "Sami killed everyone inside, including himself. What time does this museum close? Tom used to play volleyball with us. Sami doesn't know what's going on for sure.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [1308107, 9074123, 12212235],
    "There are many wild animals in this area. Algiers is a deeply conservative city. In the Danube Delta, more than 5,500 species of plants are rediscovered.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [3361767, 5292772, 12836271, 7406813],
    "But my absolute favorite is not there. I've lived here for more than three years. Bodies don't decompose in Lake Superior due to the temperature. They say they're good students.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [723227, 8572767, 12270756, 2033806],
    "He has unsightly hairs growing out of his ears. Tebboune was sworn in as Algeria's president in December 2019. It's Tom who does that, not Mary. Tom told me he doesn't want to work with you.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [5649503, 12783566, 6246028, 3098777],
    "Sometimes I'm missing all of them. We'll have to behave better from now on. My bicycle is a lot better than yours. She's the nicest person I have ever met.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [10088129, 7834607, 8904986, 11559412],
    "Algeria needs to reduce inflation. Food is what matters to people. Astana successfully hosted an internationally recognized exposition in 2017. I've rung and rung, but there's no answer.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [9974495, 13608181, 254447, 6506392],
    "Is it possible to meet at 10.30 a.m.? I ain't hungry. I've just eaten. I don't want to participate in the ceremony. I hope Tom and Mary spend a long time in prison.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [9733409, 7520238, 262904, 5852458],
    "Yanni is an interesting character. I know Tom is doing that today. We have little opportunity to use English. How are we supposed to fix these issues?",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [6491558, 3316620, 2645832, 2642296],
    "I wonder if Tom and Mary are still home. Everybody is in the basement watching the game on TV. Tom looked discouraged. Tom turned away from the window.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [8246612, 3913591, 533763, 11693762, 6228112],
    "Do you really believe in God? Let's just let her handle it. It's night and I'm still not asleep. Damiano enjoyed dinner with Rima. Was it you who was supposed to tell Tom he didn't have to do that?",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [6531972, 11511209, 10192824, 6660968, 7575302],
    "I need to buy some food. James thinks Amanda is a good girl. He gave me a blue tie. I'll be there by the end of the week. Boys think about girls a lot.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [8410489, 6415612, 3148395, 4493637, 10533650],
    "Get here as soon as possible. Mary is positive she can take care of herself. I was thinking about our first day in Boston. You have been forewarned. Ziri has a wife in the city.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [11830418, 3733715, 10143053, 7113419],
    "Ivan saw a girl being attacked by a guy. You're not very encouraging. Tom is in his room studying for tomorrow's French test. I keep having flashbacks.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [309081, 6233223, 6224834],
    "If it had not been for her help, you would never have done it. I didn't tell anyone where I'd hid the gold coins. Both Tom and I are drinking the same thing.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [1123553, 6504954, 7444188, 2012755],
    "Your ideas are a little old-fashioned. I know that Tom and Mary have finished doing that. They told me that they'd been suspended. What I want to know is why.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [7227574, 5453229, 6352978, 13674385],
    "I don't think you've been paying attention. We're ahead of schedule. Tom isn't wearing a new hat. I was watching TV when it suddenly turned off by itself.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [7266587, 2957394, 12204445, 12071776, 7384587],
    "Sami couldn't sit there for an hour. Tom kept staring out the window. What on earth did you expect? Tomorrow could be my last chance. He always does his best.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [6534641, 3024079, 3730341, 2013869, 11519753, 3909814],
    "Pardon my clumsiness. Look what I made for Tom. How much do you have invested? Do you want this or don't you? She kept all his letters. I've never seen you so angry.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [9338805, 8285149, 13164664, 5851359],
    "Yanni started to demand more of Skura's garage space. I'm going to get a bit of shut-eye. He farts in front of people without a care. I can't believe Tom really said that.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [7376329, 4665012, 3410955, 12647618, 6054172],
    "Mary said she would leave on Monday. Tom didn't attend that meeting. Tom has been to many places. Ziri is involved in this as well. The seashore looks particularly romantic in the moonlight.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [5559605, 8503927, 3991340, 6527587, 5937382],
    "You should sit with Tom. \"She knew you loved her.\" \"I know.\" Dan pretended he left something behind. Tom doesn't think he can do that by himself. I just never should've been there.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [8467135, 9334455, 3142647, 6495288],
    "Tom likes playing with people's feelings. Every human being is unique. Tom couldn't answer that question. I'm sure that Tom and Mary appreciate everything you do for them.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [12282980, 2466813, 2092479, 9795561, 6728516],
    "We had a typhoon yesterday. I'm not gonna lie to you. I've never hit anyone in my life. The girl did nothing I said. I didn't know I should do that by myself.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [6228348, 2397008, 13671242, 12117696],
    "Maybe Tom doesn't know how to do that as well as most people do. The bioluminescent bay was the highlight of our trip. The boy toyed his food. Check with your local recycling program about any food scraps they accept.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [12303596, 68638, 11652772, 2812099],
    "Our meal was delicious. That terrible noise is driving me mad. Paul never returned to that clearing in the woods. Thanks for this, I appreciate it very much.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [1231779, 4905043, 11819059, 10310733, 1855167],
    "The clients decided. Tom is afraid he'll get fired. Fyodor heard the hyena moving through the underbrush. I fancied eating an authentic pretzel. \"Let me buy you lunch.\" \"Sure. I'd like that.\"",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [10019491, 11260462, 7978293, 9189327, 6495128],
    "Tom washes his hands several times an hour. Hannibal at the gates! Sami sold his car for six hundred dollars. It didn't seem so serious to me. Tom and Mary said they don't think John really wanted to do that.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [6247056, 6868407, 10816767, 13695578],
    "I just can't believe Tom did that. I never should have told Tom that. Economic diversification can reduce unemployment. No one read the documents they signed.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [10090195, 10087626, 1291103, 12430283],
    "Yanni wants to understand Algeria's economics. The problem is that we don't have enough food. I don't think it gets any better than that! In Latin, the numbers \"unus\" and \"duus\" are inflected, but every other number word is invariable.",
  ),
  (
    Eng,
    Long,
    [1885974, 14009735, 6432891, 9777362, 275831],
    "Have you ever hugged a stranger? My spouse drove us there. Tom said he thought Mary probably wouldn't cry. Do you want to go to a football match? The majority of people marry sooner or later.",
  ),
]

